graph LR
    AP[llm-d-async<br/>Async Processor]

    %% Brokers (conditional)
    AP -->|redis-pubsub / redis-sortedset<br/>quota + rate gates| Redis[Redis / Valkey<br/>go-redis v9.23.0]
    AP -->|sql transport, sql-quota| Postgres[PostgreSQL<br/>pgx v5.12.0]
    AP -->|gcp-pubsub| PubSub[GCP Pub/Sub<br/>pubsub/v2 v2.8.0]
    AP -->|Pub/Sub backlog metrics| GCPMon[GCP Monitoring<br/>v1.32.1]

    %% Libraries
    AP -->|metrics server, signals, authn/authz filter| CR[controller-runtime v0.22.5]
    AP -->|REST config| ClientGo[client-go v0.34.13]
    AP -.->|logging, plugin TypedName model| GIE[gateway-api-inference-extension v1.2.1]
    AP -->|metrics + PromQL client| PromClient[prometheus/client_golang v1.25.0]
    AP -.->|tracing| OTel[OpenTelemetry v1.47.0]

    %% Internal platform
    AP -->|"POST inference (HTTP/HTTPS)"| IGW[llm-d-router / EPP]
    IGW -->|routes| VLLM[vLLM inference pool]
    KServe[KServe LLMInferenceService<br/>llm-d stack] -.->|hosts| IGW
    BatchGW[batch-gateway<br/>/v1/batches] -->|produces requests,<br/>consumes results via shared broker| AP

    %% Platform services
    AP -->|PromQL budget gates| Prometheus[Prometheus /<br/>OpenShift monitoring]
    Prometheus -->|PodMonitor scrape| AP
    AP -->|TokenReview / SAR| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API]
    AP -.->|OTLP gRPC| OTLP[OTLP collector]

